-Sessions never expire.
+Resume blobs are base64 of a JSON payload followed by an HMAC-SHA256 tag, keyed by the
+`SESSION_SECRET` environment variable (use `encode_session` to build one). Invalid or forged
+blobs raise `InvalidSession`.
+
+## Session expiry
+
+Each session carries an `issued_at` timestamp (set by `save_session`). Sessions expire after
+`SESSION_TTL` = 3600 seconds (1 hour): `load_session` rejects an older session with
+`InvalidSession`. `purge_expired()` deletes expired entries from the on-disk cache and is
+called on every restore.
